WEBVTT

00:03:28.079 --> 00:03:31.163
We talked to him through that closed door
for nearly an hour.

00:03:31.788 --> 00:03:34.288
And in the end, he just wouldn't come out.

00:03:35.038 --> 00:03:36.288
So, we left.

00:03:37.454 --> 00:03:40.913
About 30 minutes after leaving,
we were called to come back on scene.

00:03:40.913 --> 00:03:42.871
You see, the police had been called.

00:03:42.913 --> 00:03:44.913
He had box cutters -- a weapon.

00:03:45.538 --> 00:03:47.371
But they knew we had been there first.

00:03:48.038 --> 00:03:50.454
So the police, they waited for us.

00:03:51.204 --> 00:03:52.538
We got there,

00:03:52.579 --> 00:03:55.538
and the police were able
to convince the man

00:03:55.579 --> 00:03:57.496
to turn over his box cutters.

00:03:57.829 --> 00:03:59.163
He got dressed,

00:03:59.204 --> 00:04:00.746
and he came out of the bathroom.